  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen pressing Enter on your keyboard while having a VRC URL Input Field open the `On End Edit` will fire, but the URL wont update.\n\nWhen using the `OK` button on the VRChat Keyboard it does work correctly however.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nPressing Enter on your keyboard should fire the `On End Edit` **and** should update the URL, just like the `OK` button on the keyboard does.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://streamable.com/qy7yvp",
